# Reserved Words Demo (parser-safe subset)

payment terms is payment term count
late fee is late fee amount
grace period is grace period count

Load examples/sample_contract.txt

Document must contain payment terms
Document must contain late fee

Find payment terms and save as payment_terms
Find late fee and save as late_fee
Find grace period and save as grace_period

payment_terms must be at least 30
late_fee must be at most 500
grace_period must be at least 5
